item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/e6f907f41e25b1527a32b6427bb5fdff.webm?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/e6f907f41e25b1527a32b6427bb5fdff.mp4?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Completely accurate golf ball physics<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/66f9ebb3f065116cb4229ff811a6fd51.poster.avif?t=1706358682\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/66f9ebb3f065116cb4229ff811a6fd51.webm?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/66f9ebb3f065116cb4229ff811a6fd51.mp4?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Firefall: Can you make through the fire fall in one shot?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/e78136ece9ac740a25f6b7fa948ad949.poster.avif?t=1706358682\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/e78136ece9ac740a25f6b7fa948ad949.webm?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/e78136ece9ac740a25f6b7fa948ad949.mp4?t=1706358682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enchanted Forest: Find the quickest path to the cup<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/acf2acd0034b7770c0cd7cd8babdfea5.poster.avif?t=1706358682\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/683660/extras/acf